parts.text:
{
  "request_id": "8d503c4e6d25b7456a883e41",
  "rewritten_text": "When Hiram B. Otis, the American Minister, purchased Canterville Chase, everyone warned him he was making a mistake, as the property was undoubtedly haunted. Lord Canterville, a man of strict integrity, felt obligated to mention this during their negotiations. We have avoided living there ourselves, Lord Canterville explained, ever since my great-aunt, the Dowager Duchess of Bolton, suffered a permanent shock when two skeletal hands touched her shoulders while she dressed for dinner. I must inform you that the ghost has been sighted by several family members and the local rector, Reverend Augustus Dampier, a Fellow of King’s College, Cambridge. Following the Duchess’s incident, our younger staff refused to stay, and Lady Canterville frequently lost sleep due to mysterious noises in the library and corridor. My Lord, the Minister replied, I will take the furniture and the ghost at a fair price. I come from a modern nation where money buys everything. Given how our energetic young men are currently taking over the Old World and courting your finest actresses, I suspect that if a ghost truly existed in Europe, we would have already moved it to an American museum or put it on tour. I fear the ghost is real, Lord Canterville said with a smile, though it has eluded your enterprising showmen. It has been documented for three centuries, since 1584, and always appears before a family death. So does the family doctor, Lord Canterville. But ghosts do not exist, and I doubt the laws of nature are suspended for the British aristocracy. You are certainly very direct in America, Lord Canterville replied, clearly missing the point. If you do not mind a ghost, that is fine, but remember that I warned you. Weeks later, the sale was finalized, and at the end of the season, the Minister and his family moved to Canterville Chase. Mrs. Otis, formerly the celebrated New York socialite Lucretia R. Tappan, was now a striking, middle-aged woman with beautiful eyes and a refined profile."
}

